OL,3,ATV stars to marry in chapel home after
OL,4,Aproposal 'on Welsh soil'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe ceramicist also said there were a
OL,7,Flot of derelict chapels across Wales
OL,8,Fand "we need to repurpose these
OL,9,Fbuildings and give them a new lease of
OL,10,Flife".
